## 📈 Monitoring & Logs

### Sync Reports Stored
```
last_airport_sync_report → Most recent full sync results
airport_sync_cron_logs   → Array of last 52 cron executions (1 year)
airport_sync_log:ICAO    → Per-airport change history
```

