              </AlertDescription>
            </Alert>

            <div className="space-y-3">
              <h4 className="font-medium">Recommended Actions:</h4>
              <ul className="space-y-2 text-sm">
                <li>• Move James Rodriguez from 3 upcoming trips to reduce workload by 15 points</li>
